mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">京东发布A2P2协议：首个智能体自主支付标准，划分L0至L5六级体系</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Sensor Tower报告显示ChatGPT全球市场份额首次跌破50%大关</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic企业市场份额升至41%首次超越OpenAI，Claude Opus 4.8成主力</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱AI正式开源GLM-5.2模型，支持1M无损上下文与长程代码任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/18e55318c993f87adf34e8366570881d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智谱AI正式发布并开源新一代大模型GLM-5.2，该模型核心聚焦Coding能力与长程任务执行，在Code Arena位列全球开源模型第一。技术上，GLM-5.2实现了1M无损上下文，单次处理能力高达88万tokens，有效解决了长文本劣化问题。在FrontierSWE等基准测试中，其性能表现处于Claude Opus 4.7与4.8之间。架构方面，通过IndexShare架构将1M上下文下的单位token FLOPs降至2.9倍，并改进MTP层以提升投机解码效率。此外，模型引入思考档位（effort level）控制，显著提升了Terminal-Bench 2.1等编程评测表现。目前，GLM-5.2已基于MIT协议在Hugging Face和ModelScope开源，并完成与华为昇腾、平头哥、摩尔线程等国产算</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软Copilot Cowork拟转向按量计费，或引入Azure托管版DeepSeek V4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9995ca828e3c78d065a32073fdf6f426.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软Copilot Cowork拟转向按量计费，或引入Azure托管版DeepSeek V4AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 17, 2026156月16日，微软被曝正考虑在其Copilot Cowork中推出基于DeepSeek V4的自托管优化版本，以提供更经济的模型选择，同时该产品的定价模式也将全面转向按使用量计费。随着智能体推理任务的爆发式增长，Copilot Cowork此前采用的Anthropic Claude技术因高度依赖复杂推理，导致Token消耗量剧增。微软执行副总裁Charles Lamanna透露，原有固定费率的定价模式在用户每周执行数百项任务的重度使用场景下已不可持续，高昂的运营成本正迅速推高。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">京东发布A2P2协议：首个智能体自主支付标准，划分L0至L5六级体系</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1c432b288b60fb719f7149ee555a3c66.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">京东正式发布智能体自主支付协议（A2P2），这是国内首个面向智能体自主支付场景的系统性协议。该协议将智能体支付能力划分为L0至L5六个等级，其中L0为用户逐笔确认，L5为智能体完全自主决策。京东重点聚焦L3与L4阶段，允许智能体在预设边界内自主发起支付。为保障安全，A2P2引入ARI（智能体运行时身份）机制，实现支付瞬间用户、智能体身份及运行环境的三方实时校验。同时，协议采用“资金载体”隔离结构，为智能体分配独立受限账户，通过金额上限、场景及期限约束防止主账户风险。在结算与审计层面，A2P2通过“存证链”机制将支付结果、ARI信息与任务凭证绑定，形成完整证据链，确保AI交易的可验证与可追溯。该协议的发布标志着智能体支付从产品级能力迈向基础设施标准，为AI商业化闭环提供底层支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Sensor Tower报告显示ChatGPT全球市场份额首次跌破50%大关</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7ef0d3ebc310498966840a45ba7bead2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Sensor Tower发布的《2026年AI现状报告》显示，ChatGPT全球市场份额已从今年1月的50%以上降至5月底的46.4%。与此同时，竞争对手市场份额持续增长，Google Gemini升至27.7%，Claude达到10.3%，Grok、Perplexity、DeepSeek及Meta AI份额均低于5%。尽管ChatGPT份额下滑，但其与Gemini、Claude三大头部产品合计占据了AI助手应用总使用时长的89%。整体市场规模保持高速扩张，预计2026年上半年全球AI应用下载量将接近23亿次，用户支出超42亿美元，总使用时长预计达360亿小时，较2025年同期翻倍。报告指出，用户倾向于根据不同场景在多个AI助手间切换，行业竞争已从单一产品能力比拼转向生态覆盖、模型能力与用户留存的综合较量。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic企业市场份额升至41%首次超越OpenAI，Claude Opus 4.8成主力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">金融科技平台Ramp最新数据显示，Anthropic在企业AI订阅市场的份额已达41%，首次超越OpenAI的39.5%。尽管Anthropic近期因美国政府出口管制及安全风险评估，被迫撤出Mythos 5和Fable 5模型，并限制非美籍员工接触核心技术，但这些监管压力反而强化了其技术实力强悍的市场认知。在企业API调用及编程服务领域，Anthropic于5月底推出的Claude Opus 4.8模型成为客户下单的核心主力。分析指出，官方的“危险”定性变相提升了企业客户信心，推动其业务热度达到顶峰。尽管与白宫的持续冲突可能影响其IPO进程，但Anthropic在企业级赛道的领先地位已在短期内确立。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
